{"unit_id":"jaychang1989__dsh-webchat#card-zh","repo":"jaychang1989/dsh-webchat","commit":"2c4c711bf85a1fe15e2d33d6cc12fc81125eb640","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-webchat 是一个 DSH 桌面插件，在侧边栏添加 Chat 入口，并把 chat.deepseek.com 官方页面显示在窗口中栏。它使用桌面端浏览器访客承载网页，在切换面板时保留访客；登录状态通过页面存储和主进程可用时的 Cookie 快照恢复。还可刷新页面、把网页弹出的外链交给系统默认浏览器。需要 DeepSeek 账户及支持原生访客的 DSH 桌面端；普通 Web 环境提供独立窗口打开方式。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:584","lib/index.js:596","lib/client.js:323"]}
{"unit_id":"jaychang1989__dsh-webchat#card-en","repo":"jaychang1989/dsh-webchat","commit":"2c4c711bf85a1fe15e2d33d6cc12fc81125eb640","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-webchat adds a Chat sidebar entry for chat.deepseek.com in DSH Desktop. It keeps the browser guest alive across panel changes, saves page storage and available cookies for login continuity, supports refresh shortcuts, and opens popup links in the system browser. Requires a DeepSeek account.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:584","lib/index.js:596","lib/client.js:323"]}
