{"unit_id":"jaychang1989__dsh-webchat#feature-1","repo":"jaychang1989/dsh-webchat","commit":"2c4c711bf85a1fe15e2d33d6cc12fc81125eb640","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-webchat 的功能「侧边栏聊天页」：在侧边栏注册 Chat 入口，并在主面板显示官方 DeepSeek 网页。桌面端通过原生浏览器访客加载页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:584"]}
{"unit_id":"jaychang1989__dsh-webchat#feature-2","repo":"jaychang1989/dsh-webchat","commit":"2c4c711bf85a1fe15e2d33d6cc12fc81125eb640","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-webchat 的功能「保持网页会话」：在页面和主进程之间保存、恢复站点存储与可用的 Cookie，使登录状态可跨应用重启延续。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:323","lib/index.js:596"]}
{"unit_id":"jaychang1989__dsh-webchat#feature-3","repo":"jaychang1989/dsh-webchat","commit":"2c4c711bf85a1fe15e2d33d6cc12fc81125eb640","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-webchat 的功能「后台保留访客」：切换到其他面板时隐藏常驻网页元素，返回时重新定位显示，避免卸载访客。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:548"]}
{"unit_id":"jaychang1989__dsh-webchat#feature-4","repo":"jaychang1989/dsh-webchat","commit":"2c4c711bf85a1fe15e2d33d6cc12fc81125eb640","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-webchat 的功能「刷新聊天网页」：面板显示时注册 F5 与 Ctrl/Cmd+R 快捷键，用于刷新网页而不重载外层应用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:486"]}
{"unit_id":"jaychang1989__dsh-webchat#feature-5","repo":"jaychang1989/dsh-webchat","commit":"2c4c711bf85a1fe15e2d33d6cc12fc81125eb640","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-webchat 的功能「外链与窗口降级」：将网页弹出的 HTTP(S) 链接交给系统浏览器；没有原生访客桥接时可请求主进程打开网页窗口。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:151","lib/index.js:596"]}
{"unit_id":"jaychang1989__dsh-webchat#caveat-1","repo":"jaychang1989/dsh-webchat","commit":"2c4c711bf85a1fe15e2d33d6cc12fc81125eb640","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-webchat 使用前须知：网页内容来自 chat.deepseek.com，登录和聊天需要使用该站点账户；插件没有单独的模型 API Key 配置项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:41"]}
{"unit_id":"jaychang1989__dsh-webchat#caveat-2","repo":"jaychang1989/dsh-webchat","commit":"2c4c711bf85a1fe15e2d33d6cc12fc81125eb640","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-webchat 使用前须知：嵌入式访客依赖 DSH 桌面端桥接；没有桥接的 Web 环境会显示独立窗口打开选项。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:447"]}
